      "description": "Product leader and advisor: co-founder and Chief Product Officer at Native, external advisor to Bain & Company, and advisor to Provenance and Eureka AI. Former Expert Partner at Bain & Company, with earlier analytics leadership at McKinsey & Company and dunnhumby.",
      "disambiguatingDescription": "As of 2026-10-16, Brock Simon is co-founder and Chief Product Officer at Native (since January 2026) and holds advisory roles with Bain & Company (External Advisor), Provenance (Advisor), Eureka AI (Advisor). Brock is also a ski coach at Palisades Tahoe.",
